{"time": "2026-11-06T01:11:54.086693+00:00", "args": ["inspect", "docs/benchmarks/runs/2026-11-08-p4b/animl-rerun/sync.animl"], "code": 0, "stdout": "sync (grid 20, viewBox 0 0 20 20)\n\nglyphs (bbox: minX minY maxX maxY, grid units; hole hints use bbox containment only)\n\nnodes\n  peek (group) pivot 10,10 animates scale\n    arrows (group) pivot 10,10 animates rotate\n      upper (arc)\n      upper-head (path)\n      lower (arc)\n      lower-head (path)\n  check (path) pivot 10,10 animates scale\n\ninputs: syncing (bool), hover (bool), phase (number)\n\ntimelines\n  turn: 12s loop, reduced motion: skip\n    writes arrows.rotate\n  wait: 12s loop, reduced motion: skip\n    writes check.scale\n  pop: 0.6s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes check.scale\n  peek-motion: 0.4s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes peek.scale\n\nmachine\n  layer rotation (writes arrows.rotate)\n    *idle: play turn\n        syncing \u2192 spinning\n     spinning: play turn\n        !syncing \u2192 idle\n  layer completion (writes check.scale)\n    *rest: pose {\"check.scale\":0}\n        syncing \u2192 waiting\n     waiting: play wait\n        !syncing \u2192 complete\n     complete: play pop\n        syncing \u2192 waiting\n  layer hovering (writes peek.scale)\n    *rest: pose {\"peek.scale\":1}\n        hover \u2192 in\n     out: play peek-motion\n        hover \u2192 in\n     in: play peek-motion\n        !hover \u2192 out\n\nlisteners\n  enter \u2192 set hover=true\n  leave \u2192 set hover=false\n", "stderr": ""}
